            visibility: Internal,
            documentation: Some(
                "A showcase class exercising every standard XML documentation tag.\n\nThis class is intentionally simple: its purpose is to exercise the XML doc\nparser in `xmldoc.rs`, not to model real logic.\n\nSee also: `XmlDocShowcase` for the generic variant.\n\n- Tag `summary` — this block.\n- \n\n- Tag `remarks` — you are reading it.\n- \n\n- Tag `para` — each paragraph above.\n- \n\n- Tag `list` — this very list.\n-\n\nDeclared: `class`\n\nDeclared: `internal`",
